	(text "Firmware Thresholds @ ADC_MCU (suggested)\nESP32 ADC pin — after R116/R104 divider from 5 V ADC_RAW:\n< 0.5 V → SHORT\n0.7 V - 1.3 V → NORMAL\n1.6 V - 2.4 V → TRIGGERED\n> 2.8 V → OPEN\n\nSignal: ADC_RAW → F4 → R83/+VADC → D16 → R69 → C28 → D10 → R116/R104 → ADC_MCU"
